---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const chapters = [
  {index:'01',eyebrow:'THE BEGINNING',title:'Before the vows',body:'Before the wedding, there was us. One of our first photographs, those early conversations, and the moments when our story was only beginning.',date:'BEFORE NOVEMBER 2024'},
  {index:'02',eyebrow:'THE LITTLE THINGS',title:'The day we chose each other',body:'November 1, 2024. The day we married. And beyond that day, the beautiful, unexpected life we continue to share.',date:'NOVEMBER 01, 2024'},
  {index:'03',eyebrow:'THE REAL STORY',title:'Not always easy. Always real.',body:"We've had beautiful days and difficult ones. We have learned that love isn't about getting everything right. It's about being here, being honest, and continuing to find our way.",date:'THE HONEST PART'},
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f0e9" />
<meta name="description" content="Two years, countless memories, and a story worth continuing. For my wife, Diana. With love, Marcel." />
<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Marcel & Diana" />
<meta property="og:title" content="Two Years. Still Us. ❤️" />
<meta property="og:description" content="Two years, countless memories, and a story worth continuing. For my wife, Diana. With love, Marcel." />
<meta property="og:url" content="https://axenthoros.github.io/love-you-diana-happy-2nd-anniversary/" />
<meta property="og:image" content="https://axenthoros.github.io/love-you-diana-happy-2nd-anniversary/anniversary-share-v2.jpg" />
<meta property="og:image:width" content="900" />
<meta property="og:image:height" content="900" />
<meta property="og:image:type" content="image/jpeg" />
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="A cup of coffee with flowers and a handwritten I love you message" />
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Two Years. Still Us." />
<meta name="twitter:description" content="A story worth continuing. For my wife, Diana." />
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://axenthoros.github.io/love-you-diana-happy-2nd-anniversary/anniversary-share-v2.jpg" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<title>Two Years. Still Us. — Marcel & Diana</title>
<style>
:root{--paper:#f5f0e9;--ink:#28231f;--muted:#7b746d;--line:#d8cfc3;--accent:#987c60}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}a{color:inherit}.shell{width:min(1200px,calc(100% - 52px));margin:auto}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.21em;text-transform:uppercase}.brand{font-weight:600}.edition{color:var(--muted)}.cover{text-align:center;padding:100px 0 55px}.overline{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase}.cover h1{margin:25px 0 14px;font-size:clamp(70px,12vw,170px);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:.85;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.075em}.cover h1 em{display:block;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.06em;padding-top:.18em}.subtitle{margin-top:40px;color:var(--muted);font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,26px);font-style:italic}.cover-art{position:relative;margin:60px auto 0;max-width:1100px;height:min(55vw,590px);min-height:340px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#a99c8c,#d1c3ad 44%,#817665 100%)}.horizon{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:26%;height:1px;background:#f3e8d488}.sun{position:absolute;width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:50%;left:62%;top:12%;background:#f4d9b9a1;filter:blur(8px)}.figures{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:47%;width:200px;height:70%;filter:drop-shadow(8px 2px 14px #27221b44)}.figure{position:absolute;bottom:-25%;width:76px;height:78%;border-radius:40% 40% 12% 12%;background:linear-gradient(#413b37,#191716)}.figure:before{content:'';position:absolute;width:58px;height:65px;top:-51px;left:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#3a302a}.figure.one{left:0;transform:rotate(4deg)}.figure.two{left:77px;height:72%;width:72px;transform:rotate(-5deg);background:#534844}.figure.two:before{background:#3c312b}.art-label{position:absolute;left:28px;bottom:24px;color:#f5eee6;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em}.cover-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:20px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.13em}.intro{padding:125px 0;text-align:center;max-width:780px;margin-inline:auto}.intro h2,.closing h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,86px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.12;margin:18px 0 26px}.intro p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;color:#635b54}.rule{width:90px;height:1px;background:var(--accent);margin:38px auto}.chapter{padding:85px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:10vw;align-items:center}.chapter:nth-child(even) .art{order:-1}.chapter-no{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--accent)}.chapter h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.05em;font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,72px);line-height:1.05;margin:25px 0}.chapter p{max-width:470px;color:#686058;line-height:1.9;font-size:16px}.chapter .date{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--accent);margin-top:32px}.art{height:460px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#b8aa99}.art.a{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c3b39d 0%,#e0d4c3 39%,#62574d 100%)}.art.b{background:linear-gradient(165deg,#8c8a83,#d2c6b1 47%,#494842)}.art.c{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4b4a48,#a4a19a 55%,#d9cdbc)}.art:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:8%;border:1px solid #ffffff70}.art .number{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(160px,23vw,300px);position:absolute;right:5%;bottom:-15%;color:#ffffff3d;line-height:1}.art .caption{position:absolute;left:14%;top:13%;color:#fff9;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em}.quote{background:#302d2a;color:#f4eee5;text-align:center;padding:135px 25px}.quote blockquote{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.25;max-width:950px;margin:26px auto}.quote p{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#c7ae91}.closing{text-align:center;padding:145px 0 110px;max-width:820px;margin-inline:auto}.closing p{color:#6d645d;line-height:1.9;font-size:17px}.letter-button{margin:35px 0 0;padding:17px 34px;border:1px solid #3b332c;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}.letter-button:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}dialog{border:0;max-width:min(680px,calc(100vw - 30px));padding:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 30px 100px #0005}dialog::backdrop{background:#1d1b1ad9}.letter{padding:clamp(28px,7vw,72px);line-height:1.95}.letter .tiny{color:var(--accent);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em}.letter h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:47px;font-weight:400;margin:20px 0}.letter p{font-size:16px}.signature{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:29px;font-style:italic;margin-top:28px}.close{float:right;background:none;border:0;font-size:23px;cursor:pointer}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0 50px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em}.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .8s,transform .8s}.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}@media(max-width:700px){.shell{width:calc(100% - 36px)}.top{font-size:9px}.edition{font-size:8px}.cover{padding-top:80px}.cover h1{font-size:clamp(62px,16vw,105px)}.cover-art{min-height:430px;height:110vw;margin-top:42px}.figures{left:32%;}.sun{left:49%}.intro{padding:90px 0}.chapter{padding:65px 0;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.chapter:nth-child(even) .art{order:initial}.art{height:310px}.chapter h2{margin:15px 0}.quote{padding:95px 22px}.closing{padding:100px 0}footer{gap:20px;line-height:1.6}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.cover-art img,.art img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;position:relative;z-index:2}.cover-art img{object-position:center 40%}.cover-art .art-label{z-index:3}.art img{object-position:center}.memories{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:95px 0;text-align:center}.memories h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,74px);letter-spacing:-.045em}.memory-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px;margin-top:45px}.memory-grid figure{margin:0;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden}.memory-grid figure:nth-child(2),.memory-grid figure:nth-child(5){aspect-ratio:5/4}.memory-grid img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}@media(max-width:700px){.memory-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:9px}.memories{padding:75px 0}}
.coffee-end{text-align:center;padding:75px 0 10px;max-width:780px;margin-inline:auto}.coffee-end img{display:block;width:min(100%,470px);height:auto;max-height:none;aspect-ratio:auto;object-fit:contain;margin:14px auto 12px}.coffee-end p{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:#756b61;font-size:20px}.memory-grid figure:nth-child(8){aspect-ratio:4/5}@media(max-width:700px){.coffee-end{padding:70px 0 0}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="shell">
<header class="top"><span class="brand">MARCEL <span aria-hidden="true">&</span> DIANA</span><span class="edition">A LOVE STORY <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 2026</span></header>
<main>
<section class="cover" aria-label="Anniversary cover"><div class="overline">NOVEMBER 01, 2026 — THE SECOND ANNIVERSARY</div><h1>Two Years.<em>Still Us.</em></h1><p class="subtitle">A story worth continuing.</p><div class="cover-art"><img src={base+"photos/hero.webp"} alt="Marcel and Diana together" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" width="1600" height="1100"/><span class="art-label">THE STORY CONTINUES</span></div><div class="cover-meta"><span>EST. NOVEMBER 01, 2024</span><span>TWO YEARS TOGETHER</span></div></section>
<section class="intro reveal"><span class="overline">A FEW WORDS ABOUT US</span><h2>Not a perfect story.<br/><em>Our story.</em></h2><div class="rule"></div><p>Two years ago, we began something together. Not knowing everything that life would ask of us, or all the ways we would grow along the way. This is a little space to remember where we started, where we've been, and what still matters.</p></section>
{chapters.map((chapter,i)=><section class="chapter reveal" aria-label={chapter.eyebrow}><div class="copy"><div class="chapter-no">{chapter.index} / 03</div><span class="overline">{chapter.eyebrow}</span><h2>{chapter.title}</h2><p>{chapter.body}</p><div class="date">{chapter.date}</div></div><div class:list={['art',['a','b','c'][i]]}><img src={base+"photos/"+["early","vows","together"][i]+".webp"} alt={chapter.title} loading="lazy" width="920" height="1120" /><span class="caption">M & D / VOL. 02</span></div></section>)}
<section class="memories reveal" aria-label="Moments from our story"><div class="overline">MOMENTS BETWEEN THE MILESTONES</div><h2>The parts we carry with us.</h2><div class="memory-grid">{["engagement","engagement-kiss","rings","ceremony","courthouse","cake","roses","lock","date-night","wedding-detail","everyday","coast","later","travel","night","portrait"].map((name,i)=><figure><img src={base+"photos/"+name+".webp"} alt={"A shared memory, photograph "+(i+1)} loading="lazy" width="900" height="1100" /></figure>)}</div></section></main>
</div>
<section class="quote reveal"><div class="overline">WHAT I KNOW</div><blockquote>“Some things have changed in two years. What matters most hasn't.”</blockquote><p>FOR MY WIFE, WITH LOVE</p></section>
<div class="shell">
<section class="coffee-end reveal" aria-label="One last memory"><div class="overline">ONE MORE THING</div><img src={base+"photos/coffee.webp"} alt="A cup of coffee with an I love you message" width="899" height="1900" loading="lazy" /><p>Sometimes the smallest things say the most.</p></section><section class="closing reveal"><span class="overline">NOVEMBER 01, 2026</span><h2>Here's to us.</h2><p>The beautiful moments, the complicated ones, the laughter, the lessons. All of it belongs to our story. I'm grateful for the life we're building, one day at a time.</p><button id="letterOpen" class="letter-button" type="button">A NOTE FOR YOU <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></section>
<footer><span>MARCEL & DIANA</span><span>TWO YEARS, STILL US. / 2026</span></footer>
</div>
<dialog id="letterDialog" aria-label="A personal letter to Diana"><div class="letter"><button class="close" aria-label="Close letter" id="letterClose">×</button><span class="tiny">NOVEMBER FIRST, TWO THOUSAND TWENTY-SIX</span><h2>Diana,</h2><p>Two years ago, we promised to share a life. We've had days that felt effortless and others that asked more of us than we expected.</p><p>I don't want to pretend every moment has been easy. I want to appreciate what is real: the memories we've made, the ways we've grown, and the chance we have to keep building something meaningful together.</p><p>Thank you for the laughter, for the everyday moments, and for being part of this story. I look forward to everything we still have ahead of us.</p><p>Happy second anniversary.</p><div class="signature">Love,<br/>Marcel</div></div></dialog>
<script>
const dialog=document.querySelector('#letterDialog');
document.querySelector('#letterOpen')?.addEventListener('click',()=>dialog?.showModal());
document.querySelector('#letterClose')?.addEventListener('click',()=>dialog?.close());
dialog?.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{if(e.target===dialog)dialog.close()});
const elements=document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
if('IntersectionObserver' in window){const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('visible');observer.unobserve(e.target)}})},{threshold:.12});elements.forEach(e=>observer.observe(e))}else elements.forEach(e=>e.classList.add('visible'));
</script>
</body></html>